-  /*
-    TODO
-    4.4.4 RTCIceConnectionState Enum
-      failed
-        Any of the RTCIceTransport s are in the failed state.
-
-      disconnected
-        Any of the RTCIceTransport s are in the disconnected state and none of
-        them are in the failed state.
-
-      closed
